{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "28439861609",
      "text": "Spilled grilled onions on myself.  I smell delicious!",
      "created_at": "2010-10-22T21:06:40.000Z",
      "author_id": "2404341",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28439188159",
      "text": "My new doctor in Greenpoint asked if I drink a lot, and when I said \"Yeeeah...\" he just nodded and said \"Good, good.\" Polish doctors rule!",
      "created_at": "2010-10-22T20:56:41.000Z",
      "author_id": "528",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28431820230",
      "text": "Slowing everything down. Going on more walks. It's always now.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-22T19:06:27.000Z",
      "author_id": "3191321",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28046477328",
      "text": "\"There's no crying in software!\" - @boblord",
      "created_at": "2010-10-21T17:36:18.000Z",
      "author_id": "792690",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27956588864",
      "text": "Things I learned about VIM today: L means \"right\".",
      "created_at": "2010-10-20T18:59:22.000Z",
      "author_id": "2404341",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27852425811",
      "text": "Twitter, Facebook, Youtube, etc. are modern day smoke breaks.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-19T17:15:29.000Z",
      "author_id": "14372143",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27748704424",
      "text": "Learning HTML5 feels like learning HTML for the first time.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-18T16:11:41.000Z",
      "author_id": "48431692",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27670358672",
      "text": "Never ever say, \"this shouldn't be hard to do\" in a support request.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-17T20:43:37.000Z",
      "author_id": "9267332",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27501285310",
      "text": "I know that you trust me when you stop saying thank you.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-16T02:18:08.000Z",
      "author_id": "30923",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27492203907",
      "text": "beverage infrastructure upgrade  http://yfrog.com/5chyzycj",
      "created_at": "2010-10-16T00:23:26.000Z",
      "author_id": "3468841",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27486151774",
      "text": "Prediction: In 2030 our generation will be as embarrassed about our water waste today, as baby boomers are of littering in the 60's",
      "created_at": "2010-10-15T23:01:52.000Z",
      "author_id": "15792047",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27444504849",
      "text": "i love it when typos expose better versions of words. ex: crayz gets the point across much better than crazy.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-15T14:11:13.000Z",
      "author_id": "15517107",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27335573442",
      "text": "When the bed is making more noise than the girl, it's probably time for a change.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T12:27:36.000Z",
      "author_id": "183758055",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27313066151",
      "text": "Until Twitter, life was a regimen of unrequited afterthoughts.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T05:04:49.000Z",
      "author_id": "22872643",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27312920268",
      "text": "I bet my dignity and virginity are having a blast right now.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T05:02:11.000Z",
      "author_id": "47652631",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27309253968",
      "text": "Prove that lightning isn't wizards fighting. You can't.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T04:01:48.000Z",
      "author_id": "24008967",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 100,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27308384170",
      "text": "Lif is too short.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T03:49:20.000Z",
      "author_id": "18720595",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27306957808",
      "text": "Reading someone's code is like opening up their head & rummaging through their brain. It's their thoughts laid bare. Nothing else like it.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T03:30:03.000Z",
      "author_id": "10609",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27304453658",
      "text": "Prostitutes hate trick-or-treaters.",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T02:57:44.000Z",
      "author_id": "4230121",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "27303063690",
      "text": "While I praise the outcome, I must raise the question of how is it that the Chilean Jew miners knew not to show for work that fateful day?",
      "created_at": "2010-10-14T02:40:19.000Z",
      "author_id": "21713519",
      "public_metrics": {
        "repost_count": 0,
        "like_count": 0
      }
    }
  ],
